  "test_class": "verification_analytic",
  "title": "Transcritical flow over a bump, no shock (SWASHES)",
  "description": "Steady frictionless flow of q = 1.53 m²/s over the 0.2 m bump, with 0.66 m held downstream only while the outflow is subcritical (as in SWASHES). The flow passes through critical depth at the crest, subcritical upstream and supercritical downstream, with no jump: the depth falls from 1.01 m to 0.41 m.",
  "physics": {
